  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.8: Lands Phases 3–6 of the WYSIWYG roadmap that PRs #11–#14 nominally merged in May but never actually reached main — the four stacked PRs each used the previous stacked branch as base, so the merge commits sat on the chained branches instead of propagating to main. PR #35 cherry-picked them onto main; this release packages the result. New public `AdocNet.Avalonia.IncrementalAvaloniaRenderer` performs section-level diff-and-splice updates against an existing control tree, mirroring `IncrementalHtmlRenderer`. A new `samples/AdocNet.Avalonia.Editor` runnable demonstrates the full stack: source pane + live preview + toolbar + double-click-into-block editing + right-click context menu with AST-mutation actions that round-trip through the AdocNet.Emitter source-anchored path. See CHANGELOG.md.",
